usage: run_supported_project_reads.py [-h] [--evidence EVIDENCE]
                                      [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                                      [--artifacts ARTIFACTS] [--regressions]

Own one disposable Aspire supported-read proof; retain only metadata and
actual test results.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --evidence EVIDENCE   New directory for sanitized evidence (must not exist).
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --artifacts ARTIFACTS
                        Private reusable Debug artifacts for iterative triage;
                        omitted for fresh final verification.
  --regressions         Also run the complete Projects Integration and Server
                        test projects before teardown.
